<!DOCTYPE html>

<html>
<head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>@ViewBag.Title</title>
    <link href="~/Content/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container p-2">
        <header>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-2">
                    <div class="brand">
                        <div class="logo fw-bold" style="color:red">
                            <h2>Fahasa.com</h2>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-5">
                    <div class="row">
                        <ul class="nav">
                            <li class="nav-item">
                                <a class="nav-link" href="/Bai1/Index">Trang chủ</a>
                            </li>
                            <li class="nav-item">
                                <a class="nav-link" href="#">Đăng ký</a>
                            </li>
                            <li class="nav-item">
                                <a class="nav-link" href="#">Đăng nhập</a>
                            </li>
                            <li class="nav-item">
                                <a class="nav-link" href="#">Liên hệ</a>
                            </li>
                            <li class="nav-item">
                                <a class="nav-link" href="/Bai1/Timkiem">Tìm kiếm</a>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-3 d-inline-flex">
                    <input class="form-control" type="text" placeholder="Search"/>
                    <button  type="submit" class="btn btn-danger text-white fw-bold">
                        Tìm
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="col-2">
                    <select class="form-select">
                        <option value="">Language</option>
                        <option value="">Tiếng Việt</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>
        <main>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-3">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-10">
                            <h5 class="fw-bold text-white p-2" style="background-color:orangered">CHỦ ĐỀ SÁCH</h5>
                            @Html.Action("DSMenu_ChuDe")
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-10">
                            <h5 class="fw-bold text-white p-2" style="background-color:orangered">NHÀ XUẤT BẢN</h5>
                            @Html.Action("DSMenu_NXB")
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-8">
                    <div id="carouselExampleControls" class="carousel slide" data-ride="carousel">
                        <div class="carousel-inner">
                            <div class="carousel-item active">
                                <img class="d-block w-100" src="~/Content/HinhAnhSP/asp.net-mvc.jpg" alt="First slide">
                            </div>
                            <div class="carousel-item">
                                <img class="d-block w-100" src="~/Content/HinhAnhSP/asp.net-mvc.jpg" alt="Second slide">
                            </div>
                            <div class="carousel-item">
                                <img class="d-block w-100" src="~/Content/HinhAnhSP/asp.net-mvc.jpg" alt="Third slide">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <a class="carousel-control-prev" href="#carouselExampleControls" role="button" data-slide="prev">
                            <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                            <span class="sr-only">Previous</span>
                        </a>
                        <a class="carousel-control-next" href="#carouselExampleControls" role="button" data-slide="next">
                            <span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                            <span class="sr-only">Next</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div>
                            <div>
                                @RenderBody()
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>
        
    </div>
    <footer style="background-color:orangered" class="text-white fw-bold text-center">
        <p>Liên hệ: Khoa Công nghệ Thông tin - Trường Đại học Công nghiệp Thực phẩm Tp.HCM Link fanpage và link youtube</p>
        <p>Địa chỉ: 140 Lê Trọng Tấn, phường Tây Thạnh, quận Tân Phú, Tp. HCM. ĐT: (028)38161673 (ext 136) Mail: kcntt@hufi.edu.vn</p>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>
